    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aNo Furry Control\u300b\u00a0is a game developed by \u3055\u3093\u304b\u3063\u3051\u3044 and TJacky, featuring art and programming created by the two.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They invited RO and Rapel\u00a0 to participate in the illustration of the BOSS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you will play as a researcher, venturing into the depths to defeat and heal the infected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will engage in battles with multiple enemies, acquire cards to strengthen your character, and defeat enemies to obtain CG.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0CG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965760/extras/86e5c7b84c40bb975ee684ec1d99315f.poster.avif?t=1746201813\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965760/extras/86e5c7b84c40bb975ee684ec1d99315f.webm?t=1746201813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965760/extras/86e5c7b84c40bb975ee684ec1d99315f.mp4?t=1746201813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is presented as a turn-based card RPG, where you will interact with characters and scenes on the map, and interact with beast girls to unlock multiple animated CGs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It also includes a few puzzle elements, all played in a pixel art style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965760/extras/090855888435428320c684b76bfb2ee3.poster.avif?t=1746201813\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965760/extras/090855888435428320c684b76bfb2ee3.webm?t=1746201813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965760/extras/090855888435428320c684b76bfb2ee3.mp4?t=1746201813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aNo Furry Control\u300b\u00a0is a game developed by \u3055\u3093\u304b\u3063\u3051\u3044 and TJacky, featuring art and programming created by the two.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They invited RO and Rapel\u00a0 to participate in the illustration of the BOSS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you will play as a researcher, venturing into the depths to defeat and heal the infected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will engage in battles with multiple enemies, acquire cards to strengthen your character, and defeat enemies to obtain CG.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0CG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965760/extras/86e5c7b84c40bb975ee684ec1d99315f.poster.avif?t=1746201813\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965760/extras/86e5c7b84c40bb975ee684ec1d99315f.webm?t=1746201813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965760/extras/86e5c7b84c40bb975ee684ec1d99315f.mp4?t=1746201813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is presented as a turn-based card RPG, where you will interact with characters and scenes on the map, and interact with beast girls to unlock multiple animated CGs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It also includes a few puzzle elements, all played in a pixel art style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965760/extras/090855888435428320c684b76bfb2ee3.poster.avif?t=1746201813\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965760/extras/090855888435428320c684b76bfb2ee3.webm?t=1746201813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965760/extras/090855888435428320c684b76bfb2ee3.mp4?t=1746201813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
